# Rat Out: the target is "up to one", so the spell may be cast with none and still makes the Rat (CR 601.2c).

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Rat Out
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Swamp.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Rat Out.Cast
